What is Privacy Compliance Software?
Privacy Compliance Software comprises specialized digital solutions that help organizations adhere to data protection regulations such as GDPR, CCPA, and HIPAA. These platforms automate critical compliance functions including risk assessment workflows, data mapping visualization, consent preference management, and audit documentation. By implementing these systems, enterprises can significantly reduce regulatory risks while building stakeholder trust through transparent data handling practices.

